ort if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 228 is 2"],"reply":"Excellent, you got it fixed! This will teach this mailbox a lesson indeed! Are you interested in another assignment?"},{"cond":["quest 227 below 5"],"reply":"You are not done with your current mission. Make sure all the passages are secure. Report if you are ready."},{"cond":["quest 227 is 5"],"reply":"So you have finally made it! I did not think that you would have it in you ... However: are you ready for another assignment?"}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"Hm, I might consider your proposal, but first you will have to prove your worth by doing some tasks for us. Are you willing to do that?","alts":[{"other":true,"reply":"I thought so. The mail service is not for just anyone."}]},{"say":"advancement","reply":"You are worthy indeed. Do you want to advance in our guild?","cond":["quest 250 < quest 249"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 250 >= quest 249"],"reply":"Sorry, but you are not yet ready for advancement."}]},{"say":"yes","reply":"I grant you the title of postman. You are now a full member of our guild. Here have your own officers hat and wear it with pride.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 2","you get post officers hat"],"cond":["quest 249 is 2"],"alts":[{"cond":["quest 249 is 3"],"reply":"From now on it shall be known that you are a grand postman. You are now a privileged member until the end of days. Most captains around the world have an agreement with our guild to transport our privileged members, like you, for less gold.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 3"]},{"cond":["quest 249 is 4"],"reply":"From now on you are a grand postman for special operations. You are an honoured member of our guild and earned the privilege of your own post horn. Here, take it.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 4","you get post horn"]},{"cond":["quest 249 is 5"],"reply":"I grant you the title of archpostman. You are a legend in our guild. As privilege of your newly aquired status you are allowed to make use of certain mailboxes in dangerous areas. Just look out for them and you''ll see.","fx":["quest 250 becomes 5"]}]}]'::jsonb, false, 'Talk to Kevin and tell him that you completed the "mission" and that you brought "all" of the bones. Ask about an "advancement". You are now a Postman! (Post Officer''s Hat)');
